This Pool Cleaner offers effective pool cleaning and maintenance for different pool sizes. The cleaner has an auto-start system that is activated by the remote. Powered by your pool’s filtration system, the unit uses the existing pump to drive its cleaning mechanism. As water flows through your pool and into the cleaner the unit is propelled around the pool floor, and along the walls.
